# Varesa Columbina Ororon Xilonen. ~23s Rot. KQMS KurtC. Varesa Nightsoul Lunarcharge. 8 Plunge Varesa. 2 E Xilonen. Ororon separates skill and burst. Columbina bursts if available.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
